From e203e4c42418fd108bbbef040a6260444282181e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tsuji-riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:34:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm: add Celestial CNC1800L / D-Link DSM-232 board support

Minimal DM based port: ARM1176 core, DW APB UART console (ns16550),
APB timer driver, watchdog reset, DT and defconfig. DDR/PLL setup is
left to the vendor miniloader; U-Boot runs at 0x02000000 as the
second boot loader. Not tested on hardware.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K1YEf8BfFQRcvUTgm7e5vZ
